      "sourceUrl": "https://www.bloonswiki.com/Bomb_Shooter_(BTD6)",
      "text": "Bomb Shooter is a Primary tower. Medium placement costs 375. Its base attack launches one bomb about every 1.5 seconds at range 40, dealing 1 damage with pierce 22 through its explosion. Bigger Bombs and Heavy Bombs grow the explosion; Really Big Bombs add knockback. Bloon Impact stuns ordinary targets; Bloon Crush extends the stun to MOAB-class targets with high damage. MOAB Mauler adds bonus damage against MOAB-class targets. Frag Bombs release damaging fragments; Cluster Bombs replace them with secondary explosions; Recursive Cluster adds another generation every second attack."
    }
  ],
